                        "recommendationid": "238262823",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561199260179971",
                            "num_reviews": 1,
                            "playtime_forever": 495,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 495,
                            "last_played": 1792615710
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game was awesome! I LOVE the atmosphere, the story, the puzzles, as well as the slow build up to whats really going on. It is original and NOT another boring slasher/hacker/gore fest, which I appreciate. The forest itself is eeriely beautiful and so fun to explore. I also loved the ending, not the typical horror ending (Did you really escape? Is the enemy really defeated? or...you survived BUT the enemy got away to spawn 78 sequels). I will actually also play this game again to unlock the other achievements and trophies. I personally loved it, and would love to see a movie with the same story/ending.",
